{
  "name": "OA-01 Outreach Intake",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Three ways in\nProspects arrive through:\n- **Form** lives in **OA-00 Form Intake**, which calls this workflow via **When Executed by Another Workflow** (accept all data) -> source `form`. (n8n Form Trigger workflows cannot contain Respond to Webhook nodes, so the form is split out.)\n- **Webhook** `POST /webhook/outreach-intake` with header `x-webhook-secret` (= env `OUTREACH_WEBHOOK_SECRET`). Body: one prospect object, an array, or `{ \"prospects\": [...] }`\n- **Schedule**: picks up rows pasted into **Prospects** with status `new_import`",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "ed28e389-d7b3-9c55-bb12-25748e9b8f68",
      "name": "Note: 1. Three ways in",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -120,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Clean, dedupe, protect\nNormalise (trim, lowercase email, company domain from website or business email), validate email, then dedupe against the CRM by **email AND company domain** (free-mail domains are never used for domain dedupe) and check the **Suppression** tab. Deterministic `prospect_id` = hash of email.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "9ce7d325-9eaf-fe6c-039d-51619f47fef3",
      "name": "Note: 2. Clean, dedupe, protect",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        980,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Write + audit trail\nNew prospects get status `new` (OA-02-research-draft picks them up). Sheet-import rows are updated in place; rejected imports are marked `duplicate_email` / `duplicate_domain` / `suppressed` / `invalid_email`. **Every decision is logged to Events.**",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "d654c9d6-2274-05bc-020c-96f271f59304",
      "name": "Note: 3. Write + audit trail",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1900,
        -420
      ]
    },
